    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Agency 13</i>, a 1\u20134 player multiplayer ghost-hunting game set in a mysterious timeline and dimension centered in Ohio.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a field agent of a secret government bureau tasked with investigating and eliminating malevolent entities that breach our world from other dimensions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the victim\u2019s body \u2014 it may hold vital clues about the entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your specialized equipment to identify what you\u2019re dealing with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banish the hostile entity before it escapes or harms others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money and experience to upgrade your skills and gear. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Types of Entities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demons</strong> \u2013 Highly dangerous and intelligent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters</strong> \u2013 Sometimes aggressive, sometimes cooperative; some even seek to return to their own dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plasmoids</strong> \u2013 Lost spirits with unpredictable, often powerful abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Class:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paladin</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scientist</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class brings unique abilities and tools to your paranormal investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agency 13 has branches across the globe, but you'll be stationed in the most active hotspot: Ohio.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, Agent\u2014and happy hunting.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to <i>Agency 13</i>, a 1\u20134 player multiplayer ghost-hunting game set in a mysterious timeline and dimension centered in Ohio.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a field agent of a secret government bureau tasked with investigating and eliminating malevolent entities that breach our world from other dimensions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locate the victim\u2019s body \u2014 it may hold vital clues about the entity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your specialized equipment to identify what you\u2019re dealing with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Banish the hostile entity before it escapes or harms others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money and experience to upgrade your skills and gear. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Types of Entities:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demons</strong> \u2013 Highly dangerous and intelligent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monsters</strong> \u2013 Sometimes aggressive, sometimes cooperative; some even seek to return to their own dimension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plasmoids</strong> \u2013 Lost spirits with unpredictable, often powerful abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Your Class:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paladin</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scientist</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hacker</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engineer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each class brings unique abilities and tools to your paranormal investigations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agency 13 has branches across the globe, but you'll be stationed in the most active hotspot: Ohio.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck, Agent\u2014and happy hunting.</p>",
